@startuml kairos-create-edit-fellowship-details-sequence
title Create or Edit Fellowship

actor Admin
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Admin -> WebAdmin: Open "Add Fellowship" form
Admin -> WebAdmin: Fill data\nClick "Save"
WebAdmin -> API: POST /fellowships {data}
API -> DB: INSERT Fellowship
DB --> API: New id
API --> WebAdmin: 201 Created

Admin -> WebAdmin: Edit Fellowship\nClick "Save"
WebAdmin -> API: PUT /fellowships/{id} {changes}
API -> DB: UPDATE Fellowship
DB --> API: OK
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK

@enduml
